sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant P as GitHub Pages
  participant A as React Application
  participant J as Static Production Data
  B->>P: GET page
  alt route is the root
    P-->>B: index.html
  else deep link
    P-->>B: 404.html (app shell)
  end
  B->>P: GET bundles
  P-->>B: bundles
  B->>A: start, resolve route
  A->>P: GET data/*.json
  P->>J: read files
  J-->>A: JSON
  alt data present and within the page contract
    A-->>B: rendered page
  else a file is missing or a source is not healthy
    A-->>B: page states what is unavailable
  end
